{"parse":{"title":"技能图鉴库/终焉预兆","pageid":8712,"revid":21497,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E7%BB%88%E7%84%89%E9%A2%84%E5%85%86&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E7%BB%88%E7%84%89%E9%A2%84%E5%85%86&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E7%BB%88%E7%84%89%E9%A2%84%E5%85%86&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>终焉预兆</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E7.BB.88.E7.84.89.E9.A2.84.E5.85.86\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"终焉预兆\"><b>终焉预兆</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" style=\"max-width: 100%; overflow-x: auto; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;\">\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"5\">技能详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><img alt=\"技能 终焉预兆.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/b/b6/8pfrxc719yz4ca8i69tdhrzhf9p1091.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E7%BB%88%E7%84%89%E9%A2%84%E5%85%86.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/b/b6/8pfrxc719yz4ca8i69tdhrzhf9p1091.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E7%BB%88%E7%84%89%E9%A2%84%E5%85%86.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/b/b6/8pfrxc719yz4ca8i69tdhrzhf9p1091.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />终焉预兆\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;消耗：</b>2\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;技能类别：</b>职业技能\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;冷却：</b>/\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;攻击方式：</b>对单位\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程：</b>0-3\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程高低差：</b>↓2-↑2\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围：</b>0\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围高低差：</b>↓0-↑0\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\" colspan=\"3\">\n<p>（支援）使己方获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▲攻击3\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">▲攻击3</font></span></span>]、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"终焉预兆\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">终焉预兆</font></span></span>]，持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>回合。<br />✦若目标处于[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"冰冻\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">冰冻</font></span></span>]、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"永冻冰堑\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">永冻冰堑</font></span></span>]地形格，则对其额外治疗，治疗量为魔攻值的<font color=\"#58cb48\">30%</font>。<br />✦携带技能[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">命途所至</font></span>]时，本技能额外对目标施加[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"霜佑之印\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">霜佑之印</font></span></span>]（且不附加[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">▼速度4</span>]减益效果），效果持续至下次行动开始时。<br />✦携带技能[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">寒流奔涌</font></span>]时，本技能额外对目标范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>格内所有敌人，造成<font color=\"#ed7950\">30%</font>魔攻值的穿透范围伤害。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><img alt=\"技能范围 0-3 0.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/a/a5/s6r3gfw9b043p2s3rgg151zl3c7t66v.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_0-3_0.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/a/a5/s6r3gfw9b043p2s3rgg151zl3c7t66v.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"100\" data-file-height=\"100\" />\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E7%8F%80%E5%88%97%E7%BB%B4%E7%89%B9\" title=\"角色图鉴库/珀列维特\"><img alt=\"头像 珀列维特.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/9/9e/6maj0jhsl9v4ndxp0f513bih4hv7816.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:70px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">珀列维特</font></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门内</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n</div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\">关联内容\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left; width:160px;\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div class=\"skill_icon_box\">\n<div data-type=\"@悬浮框/技能2\" data-name=\"命途所至\" class=\"bili-tt skill_icon_bg\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%91%BD%E9%80%94%E6%89%80%E8%87%B3\" title=\"技能图鉴库/命途所至\"><img alt=\"技能背景 传说.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/3/3d/tss9yrnhzwljv1ss561dit2j2ngoe6t.png/70px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%83%8C%E6%99%AF_%E4%BC%A0%E8%AF%B4.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/3/3d/tss9yrnhzwljv1ss561dit2j2ngoe6t.png/105px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%83%8C%E6%99%AF_%E4%BC%A0%E8%AF%B4.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/3/3d/tss9yrnhzwljv1ss561dit2j2ngoe6t.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"127\" data-file-height=\"127\" /></a></div>\n<div data-type=\"@悬浮框/技能2\" data-name=\"命途所至\" class=\"bili-tt skill_icon_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%91%BD%E9%80%94%E6%89%80%E8%87%B3\" title=\"技能图鉴库/命途所至\"><img alt=\"技能 命途所至.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/3/3d/ev7no3sy3um5kueltbgazvimsp1najd.png/70px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E5%91%BD%E9%80%94%E6%89%80%E8%87%B3.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/3/3d/ev7no3sy3um5kueltbgazvimsp1najd.png/105px